# ── Rift: never commit live samples or payloads ──
# Malicious and test model files are generated locally and stay local.
# They are dangerous to load and must never enter the repo history.
# If you ever need a known-safe fixture in the repo, add it explicitly
# with:  git add -f path/to/that/file
samples/
malicious/
payloads/
